  "body": [
    "New on the shelf every Tuesday",
    "Mugs, baskets and lamps from workshops we know by name. Each one comes with a repair promise instead of a warranty card.",
    "Browse the shelf Plan a visit",
    "Open until 18:00. The colour of the day is on the board.",
    "Stoneware mug Thrown by hand, glazed twice, safe in the oven. 18.00",
    "Thrown by hand, glazed twice, safe in the oven.",
    "18.00",
    "Willow basket Woven from one season's cut. Carries a week of bread. 42.00",
    "Woven from one season's cut. Carries a week of bread.",
    "42.00",
    "Desk lamp Brass arm, enamel shade, a switch you can replace. 96.00",
    "Brass arm, enamel shade, a switch you can replace.",
    "96.00",
    "We keep a card for everything we sell: who made it, what it is made of and how to mend it. Bring a chipped mug back and we will tell you which glaze to ask for.",
    "The shelf changes every week and never holds more than thirty things. If it is not on the shelf, it is not ready."
